  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2001.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2001.02 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to the owner or operator of any stationary fuel burning device that is a source of particulate matter or visible emissions.\n\nSource. #8331, eff 4-23-05; ss by #10416, eff 9-24-13; ss by #13809, eff 11-18-23",
